                <pb facs="0811" n="707" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg707"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">352.1121 Blodgett, Walton/10: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in Spain (Bowers)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-07-01T15:00:00-04:00">July 1, 1933—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>29. Friends telegraph no relief given five prisoners Palma and situation serious.
                    Urge release be expedited.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
